2 words: AMAZING GAME!
+ Amazing Graphics;
+ Interesting Storyline;
+ Awesome Space Ninjas!
+ Great gameplay;
+ Lots of Mods, Weapons and Warframes!
+ It's NOT pay-to-win!
+ Everything that costs real money, can built and you can have anything that a paying player has, only difference is it takes a bit more time, in order to gather the parts.
Overall my opinion is that this game is AMAZING! I give it a 10/10. I really enjoy playing this.

