Pros;
Great game,good graphic,great combat.No stress gameplay.Fast action.
Cons;
Rude and irreverent developers (yea official developers and gms can INSULT you with ease and threaten to ban you) Lots of poland and russians. Some items are behind grindfest (Ivara,Atlas..)
P2P gameplay force a player host which is sucks because lots of player doesn't have over 50kb upload rate that cause lots of lags. Repetetive gameplay.

Play this game if you are willing to start over and over again your progress (even on lan server),the design and idea for the game is extremelly awesome but there are many problems that need fixing and contents already released that SHOULD HAVE THE ATENTION FROM THE DEVELOPERS instead of releasing new contents:
Examples are MORE COMPATIBILITY FOR OLDER GPUs (i have 2 gtx 660 ti on sli but can only play on lowest settings);
better models and costumization for players (seriously theres no unique model on ark,everyone looks like twins);
STOP THE FARMING OF LOW LEVEL PLAYERS (seriously cant play on official servers,its like we have a target model instead of the human one);
and many other problems that you can see if you scroll down the reviews page.
if you're okay with this and have ultra-high end GPU(titan x or 1080) the this game is a must on your library.

Pros:

-Big diversity of warframes each having their own unique abilities;
-HUGE variety of primary, secundary and melee weapons;
-Alot of modifications for each warframe/weapons are avaliable;
-AMAZING combat;
-Fast response by developers when there's something wrong within the game (bugs).
Cons:
-Heavy grinding needed.
-Hard to understand weapon and frame modding for starters.

